# Salvation Swan triggers for itself and for another Bird you control entering (CR 603.6a), not for a non-Bird. The Swan enters first
# with no creature without flying to target; the Memnite (a Construct) entering afterwards triggers nothing; Birds of Paradise
# entering exiles the Memnite, which returns at the beginning of the end step with a flying counter.

